2. Where sites for specific facilities supplied under Article 13-2 (6) are of a type prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport;
3. Where housing sites are supplied to the State, local governments, public institutions under the Act on the Management of Public Institutions or local public corporations under the Local Public Enterprises Act;
