8. Where a recipient of housing sites for commercial facilities or other profit-making uses under Article 13-2 (5) 1 concludes a trust agreement with a trust business operator under the Financial Investment Services and Capital Markets Act (hereinafter referred to as a "trust business operator") for the purpose of development or management of sale of the housing sites;
8-2. Where a recipient of land for detached or multi-unit housing concludes a trust agreement with a trust business operator to develop or provide security over the housing construction site (limited to cases where the project plan approval under Article 15 of the Housing Act is obtained by the recipient of the housing site);
