9-2. Where a recipient of housing construction land (excluding land for neighborhood living facilities) resells it at or below the price at which the project implementer supplied it and any of the following applies:
(a) The recipient of land for detached housing resells it after the final payment date for the site (or two years after the supply agreement date where the final payment date is later than that);
(b) All household members (meaning members of a household including its head; hereinafter the same shall apply) move to another Metropolitan City, Special Self-Governing City, Special Self-Governing Province, Si or Gun (excluding Guns within the jurisdiction of the same Metropolitan City) because of work, livelihood, schooling, marriage or medical treatment (limited to cases where the head of a medical institution under Article 3 of the Medical Service Act recognizes a need for treatment or recuperation for at least one year): Provided, That relocation to the Seoul metropolitan area is excluded;
(c) All household members move to housing acquired by inheritance;
(d) All household members emigrate overseas or reside overseas for at least two years;
(e) Ownership of the housing site is transferred to a spouse upon divorce;
(f) The recipient donates the housing site to his or her spouse;
