Article 17-2 (Establishment and operation of housing site information systems)
① The Minister of Land, Infrastructure and Transport shall establish every five years a plan for developing a housing site information system including the following matters to establish and operate such a system: <Amended on 2013.3.23>
1. Basic policy directions for establishment and operation of the housing site information system;
2. Development, maintenance and management of the system;
3. Installation and management of computers, communication equipment, etc. relating to the system;
4. Establishment, operation and dissemination of databases relating to the system;
5. Collection and management of information relating to the system;
6. Training of users for operation of the system;
7. Other matters necessary for establishment and operation of the system.
